# PayTabs POSTs the customer back to SITE_RETURN_URL — it MUST be a backend route
# (the Node /payment-return handler), NOT a static .html file, or you get a 404.
# It then 303-redirects the browser to SITE_SUCCESS_URL / SITE_FAIL_URL (those stay static .html).
